-- ─── Phase 8 billing + drift schema additions (CTRL-02..07) ───────────────
-- Generated by drizzle-kit, then manually augmented with CHECK constraints,
-- partial indexes, COMMENT ON COLUMN rows, and the TimescaleDB `usage_hourly`
-- continuous aggregate (Drizzle does not emit those natively).
--
-- Filename `20260428000000_phase8_billing_drift.sql` is FROZEN per D-28.
-- Idempotency: ALTER COLUMN uses ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS so re-running the
-- migration on a partially-applied dev branch is safe.
--
-- References:
--   - .planning/phases/08-auth-billing/08-CONTEXT.md D-28 (frozen prefix)
--   - .planning/phases/08-auth-billing/08-RESEARCH.md §7 (full migration SQL)

